%% Activity status model — mirrors computeState()/refreshStatus() in src/lib/server/activities.ts (IMPLEMENTED)
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> DRAFT: activity created
  DRAFT --> PROCESSING: extraction started
  PROCESSING --> DRAFT: finished, no reports yet
  PROCESSING --> REVIEW_REQUIRED: finished, reports exist
  DRAFT --> REVIEW_REQUIRED: reports generated, issues remain
  DRAFT --> READY_FOR_APPROVAL: reports generated, no issues
  REVIEW_REQUIRED --> READY_FOR_APPROVAL: zero blocking issues, fresh reports
  READY_FOR_APPROVAL --> REVIEW_REQUIRED: edit makes reports stale
  READY_FOR_APPROVAL --> APPROVED: human approves
  APPROVED --> ARCHIVED: owner or admin archives
  REVIEW_REQUIRED --> ARCHIVED: archived
  APPROVED --> REVIEW_REQUIRED: admin reopens with reason
  ARCHIVED --> REVIEW_REQUIRED: admin reopens with reason
